@startuml
' Existing architecture draft - intentionally incomplete
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "RoomVolume\nV=100 m3" as Room
component "FreshAirSource" as OA
component "ExhaustBoundary" as EXH
component "CO2 Sensor\noutput: ppm ?" as S
component "PID" as PID
component "People CO2" as P

OA --> Room : supply air
Room --> EXH : exhaust air
Room --> S : concentration
S --> PID : CO2
PID --> OA : airflow request
P --> Room : CO2

note right of S
Legacy draft assumes sensor output is ppm.
ICD-IAQ-03 later freezes the internal
feedback interface in kg/kg and adds a
normalization gain.
end note

note bottom of P
Occupancy schedule block not shown.
Source carrier-flow scaling not shown.
end note
@enduml
